<p>Build telekinetic power and dump it into an adjacent creature or yourself.</p><p>This will launch them to a targeted location in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 8.</acronym></p><p></p><p>Launched enemies take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">108, 145, 175, 199, 221</acronym> Physical damage and are stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns upon landing.</p><p>When the target lands, creatures within radius 2 take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">54, 73, 88, 100, 111</acronym> Physical damage and are knocked away from you.</p><p>This talent ignores <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 29%, 34%, 37%, 41%</acronym> of the knockback resistance of the thrown target, which takes half damage if it resists being thrown.</p><p></p><p>When used on yourself, you will launch in a straight line, knocking enemies flying and doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">108, 145, 175, 199, 221</acronym> Physical damage to each.</p><p>You can break through <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> walls while doing this.</p><p>The damage and range increases with Mindpower.</p>